From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:01 2001
From: Trey Moen <trey@moen.ai>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 17:30:00 -0700
Subject: cam: TEMP bw-vote chain breadcrumbs (wedge is inside BW blob V1)

0041 pinned the wedge INSIDE the BW-config-V1 blob update ("bw blob
update idx=1 ver=1" is the last line; no CDM submit print ever fires).
The chain is blob -> cam_vfe_top_bw_update -> cam_vfe_top_set_axi_bw_vote
-> cam_cpas_update_axi_vote -> apply_client_axi_vote -> per-port
icc_set_bw. icc_set_bw already ran clean many times at cpas_start
(sensor probe survives), so print every layer with the actual ab/ib
numbers to catch both the dying call and any bogus vote value
(tree_node_valid=false clients from hw_update_axi_vote can drive
additional_bw negative on a zero-ab vote). REMOVE when root-caused.
---

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cpas/cam_cpas_hw.c b/drivers/media/platform/msm/camera/camera_kt/drivers/cam_cpas/cam_cpas_hw.c
